  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Vinod Rathod vs The Union Of India Thr. Its Secretary ... on 30 January, 2024 Author: G. S. Kulkarni Bench: G. S. Kulkarni 910-Wp-134 S.R.Joshi In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Appellate Side Civil Jurisdiction Writ Petition No. 1344 Of 2024 Shri Vinod Rathod ... Petitio Versus The Union of India & Others ...Responde Mr. Harshwardhan Karande with Ms. Poonam Pal, for the Petitioner.",
    "facts": "The Petitioner, in fact, has contended that, by consuming some of these biscuits, the Petitioner's daughter took unwell. The Petitioner has approached the Food & Safety Authorities and various other authorities. However, the authorities have not listened to the said complaints of the Petitioner.",
    "arguments": ""
